# UNOBTAINIUM.rule - Surgical high-value rules from HIBP password analysis
#
# PURPOSE: Transformation rules NOT covered by nocap.rule (OneRuleToRuleThemStill
#          + bussin.rule). Every rule earned its place through measured crack
#          contribution against HIBP Pwned Passwords data.
#
# USAGE: Pair with large wordlists for a fast, high-yield pass:
#   hashcat -m <hash_type> hashes.txt nocap-plus.txt -r UNOBTAINIUM.rule
#
# Rules: 263 | Keyspace: 263 x 14.4M = 3.8B (~0.5s on RTX 4060 Ti)
# https://github.com/doritoes/wordforge
#
